From: eink3 <a6l@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] drm_hwcomposer: ignore listed connectors and lease them to a trusted client

vendor.hwc.drm.ignore_connectors (comma list of connector names or "mode:WxH") keeps connectors out of
UpdateFrontendDisplays(), so SurfaceFlinger never sees them. With vendor.hwc.drm.lease_socket set, a small server on an
abstract AF_UNIX socket hands a DRM lease of such a connector (+ a free CRTC and its free primary planes, which stay
reserved) to a root/system/graphics client. Hisense A6L: the rear e-ink (384x725) driven by vendor.a6l_epdd.

